<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UCP Backus raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UCP Backus raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analyst Bronwen Griffith raised her rating for Peruvian brewer Union de Cervecerias Peruanas Backus &amp; Johnston, or UCP Backus, to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a July 18 report, she set a 12-month target price of $1.02 for labor shares, or a potential appreciation of 18.7 percent from current levels.</p>
<p>-- She raised her rating in part because warmer weather in Peru caused by the El Nino meteorological effect had brought on increased beer drinking.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
